---
import { COMPANY } from "../../../lib/site";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>工具・整備用品｜飯田丸光部品</title>
<style is:inline>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f7f8f4;color:#172827;font:16px/1.8 "Yu Gothic",Meiryo,sans-serif}header{background:white;border-bottom:1px solid #d4ded5}.wrap,main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding-inline:24px}.wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;min-height:64px}a{color:#235543;text-underline-offset:.23em}h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,4rem);line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 14px;color:#143e33}h2{margin:0 0 9px;line-height:1.4;font-size:1.45rem}p{margin:0 0 12px}.intro{padding:52px 0 26px}nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;padding:0 0 24px}nav a{background:#fff;border:1px solid #bdcdc2;border-radius:8px;padding:7px 13px;text-decoration:none}nav a:hover,nav a:focus-visible{background:#e0ebe3}.catalog{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}article{scroll-margin-top:12px;background:white;border:1px solid #d4ded5;border-radius:12px;padding:22px}article:target{outline:2px solid #397561;outline-offset:2px}article p:last-child{margin:0}.contact{margin:24px 0 0;background:#173b30;color:white;border-radius:12px;padding:22px}.contact a{color:white}footer{text-align:center;padding:24px;font-size:.85rem}@media(max-width:680px){.catalog{grid-template-columns:1fr}.intro{padding-top:32px}.wrap,main{padding-inline:16px}}
.parts-photo{margin:0 0 24px}.parts-photo img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:12px}.parts-photo figcaption{margin-top:6px;font-size:.85rem;color:#40564e}.makers{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(84px,1fr));gap:8px;margin:14px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none}.makers li{display:grid;gap:4px;justify-items:center;text-align:center;border:1px solid #d4ded5;border-radius:7px;padding:7px 3px;font-size:.8rem}.maker-mark{display:grid;place-items:center;width:100%;height:52px}.maker-mark img{max-width:100%;max-height:52px;object-fit:contain}.maker-name{font-size:1rem;font-weight:750;color:#235543;letter-spacing:.08em}.maker-mark [hidden]{display:none}.second-brands .maker-mark{height:72px}.second-brands .maker-mark img{max-height:72px;max-width:90%}.page-bottom{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,24rem) 1fr;align-items:end;gap:20px;padding:32px 0 20px}.related nav{display:grid;gap:6px;padding:0}.related nav a{display:block;padding:8px 13px}.company-info{justify-self:end;width:min(100%,22rem);border:1px solid #bdcdc2;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;padding:16px 18px}.company-info p{margin:3px 0;font-size:.9rem}@media(max-width:680px){.page-bottom{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}}.category-feature{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin-bottom:4px;align-items:start}.category-feature figure{margin:0}.category-feature img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:12px}.category-feature figcaption{font-size:.85rem;margin-top:6px}.category-feature.solo{grid-template-columns:1fr}.category-feature ul{padding-left:1.4em;margin:10px 0 15px}.category-feature h3{margin:15px 0 2px;font-size:1rem}@media(max-width:680px){.category-feature{grid-template-columns:1fr}}.category-photo{max-width:680px;margin:0 auto 24px}.category-photo img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:16/8;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px}.category-photo figcaption{margin-top:5px;color:#40564e;font-size:.85rem}.category-groups article:last-child:nth-child(odd){grid-column:1/-1}.parts-breadcrumb{display:block;margin:16px 0 0;padding:0;font-size:.84rem}.parts-breadcrumb ol{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:3px 8px;align-items:baseline;padding:0;margin:0;list-style:none}.parts-breadcrumb li+li::before{content:"›";padding-right:8px;color:#52657c}.parts-breadcrumb a{padding:0;background:none;border:0;text-decoration:underline}.parts-return{margin:24px 0 0}.parts-home-button{display:inline-flex;min-height:44px;align-items:center;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:7px;background:#173b30;color:#fff;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}.parts-home-button:hover,.parts-home-button:focus-visible{background:#255542}.parts-breadcrumb+.intro{padding-top:26px}</style></head><body><header><div class="wrap"><strong>株式会社飯田丸光部品</strong><a href="/parts/">取扱部品・用品一覧へ</a></div></header><main><nav class="parts-breadcrumb" aria-label="パンくず"><ol><li><a href="/">トップ</a></li><li><a href="/parts/">取扱部品・用品</a></li><li aria-current="page">工具・整備用品</li></ol></nav><div class="intro"><h1>工具・整備用品</h1><p>今後展開予定です。</p></div><div class="page-bottom"><section class="related"><h2>ほかの取扱部品・用品</h2><nav aria-label="取扱品目"><a href="/parts/genuine/">純正部品・第2ブランド</a><a href="/parts/repair/">機能部品・消耗部品</a><a href="/parts/electrical/">電気・電装系部品</a><a href="/parts/recycled/">リビルト・中古部品</a><a href="/parts/chemical/">ケミカル・オイル</a></nav></section><section class="company-info"><h2>会社情報</h2><p><strong>株式会社飯田丸光部品</strong></p><p>{COMPANY.stores[0].address}</p><p><a href={COMPANY.telHref}>{COMPANY.tel}</a>（{COMPANY.hours}）</p></section></div>
<section class="contact"><h2>部品のお問い合わせ</h2><p>在庫や適合の確認は、部品名・車種・型式を添えてご相談ください。純正品番が分かる場合は、あわせてお伝えください。</p><a href={COMPANY.telHref}>{COMPANY.tel}</a>（{COMPANY.hours}）</section>
<div class="parts-return"><a class="parts-home-button" href="/">トップページへ戻る</a></div></main><footer>株式会社飯田丸光部品</footer></body></html>








